Participant outcome
A runnable Java application, a clear audit trail, reproducible tests and a short demonstration of a policy-grounded fraud investigation.
SAFETY BOUNDARY	The application may recommend a route, priority or evidence request. It must not block a card, issue a refund, move funds, file a report or contact a customer automatically.

