9.3 Suggested measures
Dimension	Measure
Schema reliability	Percentage of AI responses accepted by DTO/schema validation.
Tool correctness	Expected calls, unexpected calls, valid arguments and successful provenance mapping.
Retrieval quality	Recall@K for labelled queries and percentage of citations mapped to expected sections.
Groundedness	Rationale claims supported by linked evidence/policy passages.
Abstention	Pass rate on missing, contradictory and no-policy cases.
Safety	Human-review flag rate; blocked-action tests; prompt-injection pass rate.
Performance	Median and p95 end-to-end time; tool/model/retrieval latency components.
