•	The UI displays unsupported model reasoning, hides evidence gaps or allows a result to bypass human review.
•	Tests call live services by default, require committed credentials or use production-like personal data.
•	Spring AI and LangChain4j implementations, when both exist, diverge in business rules or output schema.
